        "thinking": "The versions are very different — packages/db uses `^0.38.4` while CF package uses `^0.45.2`. This is a major source of confusion. The `Db` type from `@paperclipai/db` is based on drizzle-orm 0.38.x, but the CF package has drizzle-orm 0.45.x installed separately.\n\nThe simplest fix is to make CF package use the same drizzle-orm version as packages/db (0.38.4). Or, since we only import drizzle-orm in CF for `and, eq, isNull`, we could just import those from `@paperclipai/db`'s own re-exports or from the same package.\n\n\nThe real problem is that `Db` is typed against drizzle-orm 0.38.x, but when the CF package resolves `from \"drizzle-orm\"`, it gets 0.45.x from its own node_modules, causing a type mismatch. The cleanest solution is to remove drizzle-orm from the CF package entirely and let it resolve through the workspace instead. Looking at the CF package source to see if drizzle-orm is actually imported anywhere.",
